<title>USA: Sterling Electronics says Q2 backlog fell.</title>
<headline>Sterling Electronics says Q2 backlog fell.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Electronics Corp said Tuesday that its customer order backlog fell six percent during the second quarter ended September 28.</p>
<p>The company said an increase in activity during late September and early October prompted optimism about market conditions in the third and fourth quarters.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
